        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵayice Lehobowamu ku Yelusalemu, ŵasongenye ŵandu ŵa ngondo 180,000 ŵa lukosyo lwa Yuda ni Benjamini, ŵakwete nganisyo syakuti akamenyane ni ŵandu ŵa mtundu wa Isalaeli. Kuti pakutenda myoyo amwucisye jwalakwe ucimwene wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Mlungu ŵamsalile jwakulocesya Shemaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuti akapelece utenga kwa Lehobowamu ni kwa ŵandu wosope ŵa ngosyo sya Yuda ni Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkasalile kuti, “Mkajawula kumenyana ni acalongo acimjenu ŵa ku Isalaeli. Jwalijose awujile kumangwakwe, ligongo yitendekweyi yikutyocela kwa une AMBUJE.” Ŵanduwo ŵapikanile maloŵe ga AMBUJE, ni ŵawujile kumangwawo mpela muŵaŵecetele AMBUJE.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yelobowamu akumgalawucila Mlungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yelobowamu, mwenye jwa kumpoto, ŵataŵile soni msinda ŵa Shekemu ku cilambo ca matumbi ga Efelemu, ni ŵatemi kweleko. Kutyocela kweleko ŵajawile soni kuja kutaŵa msinda wa Penuwele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yelobowamu ŵaliji mganisya mu mtima mwakwe kuti, “Muyiŵelele yindu sambano, naga ŵandu ŵanguŵa ngwakunda kwawula ku Yelusalemu ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE, kuja kutaga mbopesi kwa AMBUJE, mitima jawo tijiciwujila kwa Lehobowamu, mwenye jwa ku Yuda, nipo tacimbulaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.26+1KI.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.26",
              "1KI.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo mwenyewo ali aganisisye cenene pa yele yinduyi, ŵagumbile ŵanace ŵaŵili ŵa ng'ombe ŵa golidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Ni ŵasalile ŵandu ŵakwe kuti, “Jemanja, Aisalaeli, mŵele mli mkwawula ku Yelusalemu kwa ndaŵi jelewu. Pangali ligongo lya kwawulila kweleko sambano, ligongo milungu jenu ni aji, jijamkopwesye jemanja kutyocela ku Iguputo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.32.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 32:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Yelobowamu ŵajigele mwanace jumo jwa ng'ombe jwagumba ni golidi, ni ŵamŵisile mu msinda wa Beteli, jwine ŵajile kumŵika mu msinda wa Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵalemwisye, pakuja kupopela ku Beteli ni ku Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yelobowamu ŵataŵile soni nyumba pa malo gakulambila, ni ŵasagwile ŵakutaga mbopesi ŵa mkanaŵa ŵa lukosyo lwa Lefi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kupopela ku Beteli kukulekasidwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
